The system-audio tap that ships inside Acoustic Orbit
(AcousticOrbitTap.driver, the "Acoustic Orbit" audio device; until
driver version 3, SpeakerLCRTap.driver and the "Speaker LCR" device) is
a modified version of BlackHole.

